OL,3,GNEWSABluetongue restrictions continue
OL,4,Awith disease 'not going away'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBluetongue is circulating in the
OL,7,Fsouth-west of Scotland, the Scottish
OL,8,Fgovernment has confirmed as it
OL,9,Fannounced that livestock movement
OL,10,Frestrictions in the area are set to
OL,11,Fcontinue.
OL,13,FMuch of Dumfries and Galloway and parts
OL,14,Fof Ayrshire have been subject to a
OL,15,Ftemporary control zone since last month
OL,16,Fbut from Thursday it will join England
OL,17,Fand Wales in becoming a restricted
OL,18,Fzone.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
