OL,3,GNEWSABluetongue restrictions continue
OL,4,Awith disease 'not going away'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt means livestock such as cattle,
OL,7,Fsheep and other susceptible ruminants
OL,8,Fwill still need a licence if they are
OL,9,Fbeing moved out of the restricted zone
OL,10,Fto the rest of Scotland.
OL,12,FAgriculture Minister Jim Fairlie said
OL,13,Fthe industry should start to prepare
OL,14,Ffor the disease "gaining a permanent
OL,15,Fhold within the rest of Scotland".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
